</section></score></mdiv></body>
<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>As rays of light from yonder sun,</l><l>The flow’rs of earth set free,</l><l>So life and light and love come forth</l><l>From Christ living in me.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>As lives the flow’r within the seed,</l><l>As in the cone the tree,</l><l>So, praise the Christ of truth and grace,</l><l>His Spirit dwelleth in me.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>With longing all my heart is filled,</l><l>That like Him I may be,</l><l>As on the wondrous thought I dwell</l><l>That Christ liveth in me.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
